  "task_contract": {
    "asset_revision": "a9de559b54849a25988a8a0d8a5e869063a5a7a3",
    "helpers": "background randoms and theta supplied; (1,128,128) activity truth solver-visible",
    "live_generic_output": "output/reconstruction.npy",
    "operator": "C ~ Poisson(1000 * (A x + r)); stored y=C/1000. Source MLEM multiplies by B(y/(A x+r))/B1, with iradon B not proven exact discrete transpose.",
    "output": "(1,128,128) nonnegative activity; source-saved 50-step MLEM and log-likelihood",
    "raw": "(1,128,120) projection sinogram and background; 120 view angles in degrees",
    "source_commit": "dc2f668939b21e8312e22529615def610f8611df",
    "source_main_output": "task-specific .npz under output/ or evaluation/reference_outputs",
    "units": "C~Poisson(1000*(A x+r)), stored y=C/1000 and r in original relative projection scale. Angles0..178.5deg, radial index not calibrated mm; no SUV/Bq or attenuation/scatter normalization.",
    "updates": "Source B is iradon(filter_name=None,circle=True), not verified exact discrete A transpose. x starts1, floors1e-10; MLEM x<-x/B1*B(y/max(Ax+r,1e-10)),50 iterations. OSEM10 full cycles,6 interleaved subsets of20 angles; subset sensitivity recomputed,60 updates. No explicit regularization/stopping test.",
    "history": "MLEM stored likelihood uses expected computed before update; OSEM recomputes after full cycle. Uses scaled y, omits exposure1000 and log-factorial constants; not literal raw-count log likelihood. No new history computed.",
    "scorer_route": "Filesystem generic scorer selects activity_map from data/ground_truth.npz and squeezes its (1,128,128) shape to (128,128); scaled y is not a raw integer count array. No-filesystem scoring instead requires generic ground_truth.npy, absent from both data and reference_outputs in the pinned tree. No metrics.json boundary file is listed; main.py derived masked-baseline thresholds are a source recipe, not a retained generic verdict."
  },
